<section class="route workspace-overview" data-route-view data-route-key="<%= page.route.key %>">
  <% if (page.accessNotice) { %><output class="toast" data-access-notice><%= page.accessNotice %></output><% } %>
  <header class="workspace-welcome"><span class="cortex-eyebrow">YOUR TRADING WORKSPACE</span><h1>Research an idea.<br>Practice your next move.</h1><p>Explore market evidence, trade current prices with virtual funds, and manage real accounts in their own workspace.</p><div class="workspace-actions"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/practice" data-nav-link>Open paper trading ↗</a><a class="btn" href="/research" data-nav-link>Start research</a></div></header>
  <div class="workspace-section-title"><h2>Ready when you are</h2><span data-overview-status>Checking your setup…</span></div>
  <ol class="setup-steps">
    <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Research the market</h3><p>Give an agent your question, inspect the evidence, and keep the lessons that matter.</p><small data-overview-research>Checking saved research…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/research" data-nav-link>Research desk ↗</a></li>
    <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Practice with live prices</h3><p>Create a virtual account, place paper trades, or observe a strategy as markets move. Public crypto and prediction feeds need no account key.</p><small data-overview-providers>Checking optional research providers…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/practice" data-nav-link>Practice lab ↗</a></li>
    <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Manage real accounts</h3><p>Review balances and broker requests in the live workspace. Your practice accounts never submit real orders.</p><small data-overview-broker>Checking account connection…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/live" data-nav-link>Live workspace ↗</a></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="workspace-overview-foot"><p data-overview-lock>Exploring the workspace uses no AI tokens.</p><a href="/settings" data-nav-link>Profile, connections &amp; AI access ↗</a><a href="/journal" data-nav-link>Open your journal ↗</a></div>
</section>
